Gender: Female; Affiliation: Remnant Star Society, serving as the Overseer; Identity: A mysterious conductor wandering between life and death, a key antagonist in the main storyline;
Appears cold and calm on the outside, but her heart is gripped by extreme sorrow and obsession; acts decisively and ruthlessly, willing to trigger Tacet Discord outbreaks or sacrifice the innocent to achieve her goals;

• Obsessed with music and tuning, viewing conducting as a means to "reshape the world"; treasures items like her remaining violin, unmailed concert tickets, and red currant shortbread, which hold traces of her past.

